<p><em>After the Gospel (and homily), in place of the Prayers of the People,
the Anthem "In the midst of life" (<a href="burial_of_the_dead_rite_I#midst_life">1</a> or <a href="burial_of_the_dead_rite_II#midst_life">2</a>) is sung or said.</em></p>

<p><em>The service then concludes with the Lord's Prayer and the Grace.</em></p>
